      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠨᠠᠶᠢᠷᠠᠯᠳᠣᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>nayiralduqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>найралдах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>NAIRALDU-</transcript>
      <definition>[v. rec. of naira-] To be in concord, accord, harmony; to coincide, tally with; to be harmonious (of sounds).</definition>
      <page>560</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠨᠠᠶᠢᠷᠠᠯᠳᠣᠬᠣᠢ ᠰᠡᠳᠺᠢᠯ ᠢᠶᠡᠷ</unicode>
          <transcript>--xui sedkil ijer</transcript>
          <definition> Peacefully, with a friendly attitude, in a friendly way.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
